  "body": "## Summary\n\nThis change updates the LinuxCNC post header in `assets/posts/linuxcnc.cps`. It clears `G92` offsets and states `G97` constant RPM mode before the first spindle start.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Clear active `G92` offsets by emitting `G92.1` in the header safety block.\n- Add `clearG92` boolean post property (default `true`) to allow retaining `G92` offsets when requested.\n- State `G97` in the header modal safety block so that prior modal `G96` constant surface speed mode does not carry over.\n- Add `\"G92.1\"` word explanation to `explainWords`.\n- Update `CODES` allowlist and header assertions in `crates/app/tests/linuxcnc_post.rs` to permit `G92.1` and `G97`.\n- Regenerate conformance test goldens for LinuxCNC.\n- Record architectural decision in `docs/decisions/4151-linuxcnc-g92-clear-g97-state.md`.\n\n## Readings\n\n- LinuxCNC G-code Reference (linuxcnc.org/docs) for `G92.1` and `G97`.\n\n## Pinning Tests\n\n- `crates/post/tests/linuxcnc_post.rs`:\n  - `header_clears_g92_and_states_g97_by_default`\n  - `header_omits_g92_1_when_clearg92_option_is_false`\n  - `header_includes_g92_1_when_clearg92_option_is_true`\n- `crates/app/tests/linuxcnc_post.rs`:\n  - `a_stated_safe_z_is_the_retract_before_m6_and_at_the_end`\n- `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs`:\n  - `every_builtin_posts_every_golden_byte_exact`\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nThe following goldens moved because header line adds G92.1 and G97, #4151:\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/contour_disc_hole.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/contour_plate_with_hole.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/contour_tangential_lead.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/drill_peck.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/drill_plate.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/face_square_40x40.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/face_square_40x40_stepped.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/pocket_waterline_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/slot_fullwidth_centerline.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/slot_wide_channel_rows.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/trace_plate_with_hole.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/synth_linuxcnc.nc`\n\n## Not Exercised\n\n- Physical machine execution on LinuxCNC hardware.\n\nChangelog: Clear G92 offsets and state G97 constant spindle RPM in LinuxCNC post header.\n\nFixes #4151\n",
